#: /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:83 /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:86
#: /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:95 /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:97
#: /tmp/opencode/schema_calls.php:9
msgid ""
"One IP per line. These are treated as \"own\" -- any other IP is considered "
"a foreign host."
msgstr ""
"Eine IP pro Zeile. Diese gelten als \"eigene\" -- jede andere IP gilt als "
"fremder Host."

#: /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:89 /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:92
#: /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:101 /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:103
#: /tmp/opencode/schema_calls.php:24
msgid ""
"Adapters detected automatically from utils/web/. Adding a new backend "
"(nginx, ...) only requires dropping the file in."
msgstr ""
"Adapter werden automatisch aus utils/web/ erkannt. Ein neues Backend "
"(nginx, ...) erhält man allein durch Einlegen der Datei."

#: /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:90 /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:93
#: /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:102 /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:104
#: /tmp/opencode/schema_calls.php:28
msgid ""
"Directory containing <name>.pem + <name>.key certificate pairs (wildcard = "
"\"_.domain.tld\"). Must be readable by pmwh3 for the certificate selection "
"and by the web server, since the paths are rendered into the vhost as "
"SSLCertificateFile/KeyFile."
msgstr ""
"Verzeichnis mit <name>.pem + <name>.key-Zertifikatspaaren (Wildcard = "
"\"_.domain.tld\"). Muss von pmwh3 für die Zertifikatsauswahl lesbar sein und "
"vom Webserver, da die Pfade als SSLCertificateFile/KeyFile in den Vhost "
"gerendert werden."

#: /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:95 /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:98
#: /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:107 /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:109
#: /tmp/opencode/schema_calls.php:38
msgid ""
"Inserted into every generated vhost. Placeholders: [DOMAIN], [SUBDOMAIN], "
"[DOCROOT], [CUSTOMER]"
msgstr ""
"Wird in jeden generierten Vhost eingefügt. Platzhalter: [DOMAIN], "
"[SUBDOMAIN], [DOCROOT], [CUSTOMER]"

#: /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:98 /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:101
#: /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:110
msgid ""
"Role forwards created on the FIRST mailbox of a domain, pointing to that "
"mailbox. postmaster@ is mandatory (RFC 2142) and is always created; every "
"other role comes from this comma list (default webmaster, abuse, hostmaster)."
msgstr ""
"Rollen-Forwards, die beim ersten Postfach einer Domain angelegt und auf "
"dieses gerichtet werden. postmaster@ ist Pflicht (RFC 2142) und wird immer "
"angelegt; alle weiteren Rollen kommen aus dieser Kommaliste (Standard "
"webmaster, abuse, hostmaster)."

#: /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:99 /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:102
#: /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:111
msgid ""
"Sent to a freshly created mailbox (initialises the maildir via first "
"delivery). Placeholders: [EMAILUSER], [EMAIL], [DOMAIN], [CREATOR], "
"[CREATOR_REALNAME]. Empty = no welcome mail."
msgstr ""
"Geht an ein frisch angelegtes Postfach (initialisiert die Maildir per erster "
"Zustellung). Platzhalter: [EMAILUSER], [EMAIL], [DOMAIN], [CREATOR], "
"[CREATOR_REALNAME]. Leer = keine Willkommensmail."

#: /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:100 /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:103
#: /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:112 /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:114
#: /tmp/opencode/schema_calls.php:56
msgid ""
"Numeric UID stored in the proftpd row. Must be >= SQLMinID in proftpd config "
"(typically 500)."
msgstr ""
"Numerische UID in der proftpd-Zeile. Muss >= SQLMinID in der proftpd-"
"Konfiguration sein (üblicherweise 500)."

#: /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:101 /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:104
#: /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:113 /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:115
#: /tmp/opencode/schema_calls.php:58
msgid ""
"Numeric GID stored in the proftpd row. Used unless a per-domain group exists."
msgstr ""
"Numerische GID in der proftpd-Zeile. Verwendet, sofern keine domänenbezogene "
"Gruppe existiert."

#: /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:102 /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:105
#: /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:114 /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:116
#: /tmp/opencode/schema_calls.php:60
msgid ""
"Default limit_type for new proftpd_quotalimits rows. soft = warn; hard = "
"block."
msgstr ""
"Standard-limit_type für neue proftpd_quotalimits-Zeilen. soft = warnen; hard "
"= blockieren."

#: /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:103 /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:106
#: /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:115 /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:117
#: /tmp/opencode/schema_calls.php:64
msgid ""
"When off, plain passwords are stored. When on, SHA-256 hex (proftpd "
"SQLPasswordEngine on / Encoding hex)."
msgstr ""
"Wenn aus, werden Klartext-Kennwörter gespeichert. Wenn an, SHA-256 hex "
"(proftpd SQLPasswordEngine an / Encoding hex)."

#: /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:106 /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:109
#: /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:118 /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:120
#: /tmp/opencode/schema_calls.php:70
msgid ""
"Adapters detected automatically from utils/dns/. Adding a new adapter only "
"requires dropping the file in."
msgstr ""
"Adapter werden automatisch aus utils/dns/ erkannt. Ein neuer Adapter erhält "
"man nur durch Einlegen der Datei."

#: /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:107 /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:110
#: /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:119 /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:121
#: /tmp/opencode/schema_calls.php:72
msgid ""
"Where pmwh3_filtering / pmwh3_wblist are exported to. rspamd serves HTTP map "
"endpoints (rspamd pulls), none keeps the tables UI-only."
msgstr ""
"Wohin pmwh3_filtering / pmwh3_wblist exportiert werden. rspamd bedient HTTP-"
"Map-Endpunkte (rspamd zieht), none belässt die Tabellen rein UI."

#: /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:108 /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:111
#: /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:120 /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:122
#: /tmp/opencode/schema_calls.php:76
msgid ""
"Optional shared secret; rspamd map URLs must then carry ?key=<token>. Empty "
"= open (internal network only)."
msgstr ""
"Optionaler gemeinsamer Schlüssel; rspamd-Map-URLs müssen dann ?key=<token> "
"tragen. Leer = offen (nur internes Netz)."

#: /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:109 /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:112
#: /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:121 /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:123
#: /tmp/opencode/schema_calls.php:78
msgid ""
"Used by pmwh3 for ping / stat / learning calls. Default http://rspamd:11334; "
"empty disables API calls."
msgstr ""
"Von pmwh3 für ping / stat / learning-Aufrufe verwendet. Standard http://"
"rspamd:11334; leer deaktiviert API-Aufrufe."

#: /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:110 /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:113
#: /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:122 /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:124
#: /tmp/opencode/schema_calls.php:80
msgid "Optional; sent as the \"Password\" header to the controller API."
msgstr "Optional; wird als \"Password\"-Header an die Controller-API gesendet."

#: /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:111 /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:114
#: /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:123 /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:125
#: /tmp/opencode/schema_calls.php:82
msgid ""
"For message checks from pmwh3 (POST /checkv2), Default http://rspamd:11333; "
"empty disables the scan helper."
msgstr ""
"Für Nachrichtenprüfung von pmwh3 (POST /checkv2). Standard http://"
"rspamd:11333; leer deaktiviert den Scan-Helfer."

#: /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:112 /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:115
#: /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:124 /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:126
#: /tmp/opencode/schema_calls.php:84
msgid ""
"host:port of the doveadm-server inside the dovecot container (None then live "
"quota lookups). Used by the mail adapter (postfix) for accurate \"used\" "
"numbers that match what mail clients see."
msgstr ""
"host:port des doveadm-Servers im dovecot-Container (None dann Live-Quota-"
"Abfragen). Vom Mail-Adapter (postfix) für genaue \"used\"-Zahlen verwendet, "
"die dem entsprechen, was Mail-Clients sehen."

#: /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:113 /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:116
#: /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:125 /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:127
#: /tmp/opencode/schema_calls.php:86
msgid ""
"Shared secret for the doveadm-server (must match the dovecot config). Stored "
"plain in pmwh3_configuration like the other service credentials."
msgstr ""
"Gemeinsames Geheimnis für den doveadm-Server (muss der dovecot-Konfiguration "
"entsprechen). Wird wie die übrigen Dienst-Zugangsdaten in "
"pmwh3_configuration gespeichert."

#: /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:114 /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:117
#: /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:126 /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:128
#: /tmp/opencode/schema_calls.php:88
msgid ""
"Directory for pmwh3 SQL dumps. Must NOT be inside the source tree and must "
"be writable by the web server user. The directory is created on first backup."
msgstr ""
"Verzeichnis für pmwh3-SQL-Dumps. Darf NICHT im Quellbaum liegen und muss für "
"den Webserver-Benutzer beschreibbar sein. Das Verzeichnis wird beim ersten "
"Backup angelegt."

#: /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:115 /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:118
#: /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:127 /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:129
#: /tmp/opencode/schema_calls.php:90
msgid ""
"Base URL of the PowerDNS HTTP API, e.g. http://pdns:8081/api/v1. Required "
"for DNSSEC zone signing / disabling. If empty, DNSSEC is read-only."
msgstr ""
"Basis-URL der PowerDNS-HTTP-API, z. B. http://pdns:8081/api/v1. Erforderlich "
"für DNSSEC-Zonen-Signierung/Deaktivierung. Wenn leer, ist DNSSEC "
"schreibgeschützt."

#: /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:116 /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:119
#: /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:128 /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:130
#: /tmp/opencode/schema_calls.php:92
msgid ""
"Value of the api-key= setting in pdns.conf. Sent as the X-API-Key header."
msgstr ""
"Wert der Einstellung api-key= in pdns.conf. Wird als X-API-Key-Header "
"gesendet."

#: /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:117 /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:120
#: /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:129 /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:131
#: /tmp/opencode/schema_calls.php:94
msgid ""
"Server identifier in the API path (.../api/v1/servers/<server_id>/...). "
"Defaults to \"localhost\", which is correct for almost every install."
msgstr ""
"Server-Kennung im API-Pfad (.../api/v1/servers/<server_id>/...). Standard "
"ist \"localhost\", was für fast jede Installation korrekt ist."

#: /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:118 /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:121
#: /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:130 /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:132
#: /tmp/opencode/schema_calls.php:101
msgid ""
"Which DB server pmwh3 provisions customer databases on. Only mysql is "
"implemented for now; the value is here so adapter selection can be added "
"later (postgres, etc)."
msgstr ""
"Auf welchem DB-Server pmwh3 Kundendatenbanken bereitstellt. Derzeit ist nur "
"mysql implementiert; der Wert ist hier, damit später die Adapterauswahl "
"ergänzt werden kann (postgres, usw.)."

#: /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:119 /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:122
#: /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:131 /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:133
#: /tmp/opencode/schema_calls.php:104
msgid ""
"Hostname or IP of the database server pmwh3 should provision new customer "
"databases on."
msgstr ""
"Hostname oder IP des Datenbankservers, auf dem pmwh3 neue Kundendatenbanken "
"anlegen soll."

#: /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:120 /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:123
#: /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:132 /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:134
#: /tmp/opencode/schema_calls.php:107
msgid ""
"User pmwh3 connects with to run CREATE DATABASE / GRANT / DROP. Needs "
"CREATE, GRANT OPTION, DROP, and the ability to create users (CREATE USER). "
"Not root by default -- a dedicated pmwh3_admin user is recommended."
msgstr ""
"Benutzer, mit dem pmwh3 CREATE DATABASE / GRANT / DROP ausführt. Benötigt "
"CREATE, GRANT OPTION, DROP und die Fähigkeit, Benutzer anzulegen (CREATE "
"USER). Standardmäßig nicht root -- ein dedizierter pmwh3_admin-Benutzer wird "
"empfohlen."

#: /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:121 /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:124
#: /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:133 /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:135
#: /tmp/opencode/schema_calls.php:109
msgid ""
"Password for the DB admin user above. Stored as plain text in "
"pmwh3_configuration. Make sure the file/DB is not world-readable."
msgstr ""
"Kennwort für den DB-Admin-Benutzer oben. Wird als Klartext in "
"pmwh3_configuration gespeichert. Stellen Sie sicher, dass die Datei/DB nicht "
"weltweit lesbar ist."

#: /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:122 /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:125
#: /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:134 /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:136
#: /tmp/opencode/schema_calls.php:111
msgid ""
"How new database names are composed. customer = prefix with the customer "
"name and underscore (e.g. customer_blog). none = use the suffix as-is."
msgstr ""
"Wie neue Datenbanknamen zusammengesetzt werden. customer = Präfix mit "
"Kundenname und Unterstrich (z. B. customer_blog). none = Suffix unverändert "
"verwenden."

#: /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:123 /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:126
#: /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:135 /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:137
#: /tmp/opencode/schema_calls.php:115
msgid ""
"The HOST part of new GRANTs (user@host). % allows connections from anywhere; "
"localhost or an IP restricts access. % is the usual choice when the web "
"server and the database server are separate containers/hosts."
msgstr ""
"Der HOST-Teil neuer GRANTs (user@host). % erlaubt Verbindungen von überall; "
"localhost oder eine IP schränkt den Zugriff ein. % ist die übliche Wahl, "
"wenn Webserver und Datenbankserver getrennte Container/Hosts sind."

#: /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:124 /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:127
#: /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:136 /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:138
#: /tmp/opencode/schema_calls.php:117
msgid ""
"Show per-grant privilege checkboxes (SELECT/INSERT/UPDATE/...) in the new-"
"user form. Off = \"full access\" toggle only."
msgstr ""
"Einzelne Grant-Rechte-Kontrollkästchen (SELECT/INSERT/UPDATE/...) im Neuer-"
"Benutzer-Formular anzeigen. Aus = nur \"voller Zugriff\"-Umschalter."

#: /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:125 /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:128
#: /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:137 /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:139
#: /tmp/opencode/schema_calls.php:119
msgid ""
"Full URL of a phpMyAdmin instance, including scheme (e.g. https://"
"pma.example.com). Used by the \"Phpmyadmin\" sidebar link in the Databases "
"box; opens in a new tab. Leave empty to hide the link."
msgstr ""
"Vollständige URL einer phpMyAdmin-Instanz inkl. Schema (z. B. https://"
"pma.example.com). Wird vom \"Phpmyadmin\"-Seitenleisten-Link im Bereich "
"Datenbanken verwendet; öffnet in einem neuen Tab. Leer lassen, um den Link "
"auszublenden."

#: /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:126 /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:129
#: /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:138
msgid ""
"On a new domain, automatically create the standard subdomains from the "
"pattern below. Only when the customer row has \"Standard subdomains\" "
"checked."
msgstr ""
"Legt bei einer neuen Domain automatisch die Standard-Subdomains aus dem "
"Muster unten an. Nur wenn in der Kundenzeile \"Standard-Subdomains\" "
"angeschaltet ist."

#: /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:127 /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:130
#: /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:139
msgid ""
"Format: name(alias1,alias2);name(alias1) -- name becomes a directory "
"subdomain, the aliases become alias rows of it."
msgstr ""
"Format: name(alias1,alias2);name(alias1) -- name wird eine Directory-"
"Subdomain, die Aliase werden alias-Zeilen davon."

#: /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:129 /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:132
#: /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:141 /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:140
#: /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:142
msgid ""
"Show a confirmation dialog before saving changes (e.g. password resets, "
"DNSSEC signing). When off, changes apply immediately."
msgstr ""
"Vor dem Speichern von Änderungen einen Bestätigungsdialog anzeigen (z.B. "
"Passwort-Reset, DNSSEC-Signierung). Bei deaktiviert greifen Änderungen "
"sofort."

#: /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:130 /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:133
#: /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:142 /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:141
#: /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:143
msgid ""
"Show a confirmation dialog before deleting entries (customers, domains, "
"mailboxes, records, etc.). When off, deletes apply immediately."
msgstr ""
"Vor dem Löschen von Einträgen einen Bestätigungsdialog anzeigen (Kunden, "
"Domains, Mailboxen, Records usw.). Bei deaktiviert werden Löschungen sofort "
"ausgeführt."

#: /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:131 /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:134
#: /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:143
msgid ""
"How many news items the login ticker and the admin news overview show at "
"most."
msgstr ""
"Wie viele News-Einträge der Login-Ticker und die Admin-News-Übersicht "
"maximal anzeigen."

#: /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:132 /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:135
#: /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:144 /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:143
#: /tmp/pmwh3_schema_seed.php:142
msgid ""
"Where errors are written. \"file\" writes to the log path the cevian "
"deployment configures (php_settings.error_log_path in config/app.json, "
"default var/log/error.log). \"syslog\" goes to the system logger (not "
"viewable in the Errorlog viewer). \"db\" persists into pmwh3_errorlog (table "
"created on first write)."
msgstr ""
"Wohin Fehler geschrieben werden. \"file\" schreibt in den Log-Pfad, den die "
"Cevian-Deployment-Konfiguration setzt (php_settings.error_log_path in config/"
"app.json, Standard var/log/error.log). \"syslog\" geht an den System-Logger "
"(im Errorlog-Viewer nicht sichtbar). \"db\" speichert in pmwh3_errorlog "
"(Tabelle wird beim ersten Schreiben angelegt)."

